Website Page Plan
1. Public Facing (Guest)
Landing Page: High-conversion hero section, "How it Works" (Invite/Watch/Earn), and Call to Action (CTA).

Authentication: Social Login integration (Google/Facebook) and traditional Email/Password.

About & FAQ: Clear explanation of the 3-level invite system and payment thresholds.

2. User Portal (The Dashboard)
Earnings Overview: Real-time balance (Ad revenue, Spin rewards, Referral commissions).

Earning Center: Dedicated zones for "Watch Ads" and the "Daily Spin" wheel.

Referral Management: 3-tier tree view showing Level 1, 2, and 3 recruits and total commission from each.

Wallet/Withdrawal: Interface to link payment methods and request payouts.

Profile/Settings: Management of user roles and personal data.

3. Admin Portal (Control Center)
User Management: Search, ban, or verify users; manually adjust roles.

Ad & Spin Manager: Set the "Price per View" for ads and the probability/reward amounts for the spin wheel.

Finance/Payout Queue: Approve or reject withdrawal requests.

System Analytics: Track total platform revenue vs. user payouts.